  "courseDescription": "This course covers the principles of digital logic design, including data representation in digital systems, Boolean\nalgebra, and logic function implementation. It introduces combinational and sequential logic design, computer-aided\ndesign (CAD) tools, hardware description languages, and the use of artificial intelligence (AI) methods for digital logic\ncircuit design and optimization. Sustainability is emphasized through circuit minimization. Laboratory experiments\nprovide hands-on experience with simulating, implementing, and testing digital circuits.",
